WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.000 --> 00:01.240
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions, or events shown in the series

4
00:01.260 --> 00:02.500
are entirely fictional, solely for the purpose of entertainment,

5
00:02.500 --> 00:03.740
with no intention to instruct or promote any kind of behavior;

6
00:03.750 --> 00:04.890
viewer discretion is advised]

7
00:05.250 --> 00:06.990
I merely wish

8
00:07.440 --> 00:09.980
to share my life with my karmic soulmate

9
00:10.440 --> 00:12.730
till fate do us part.

10
00:14.210 --> 00:15.030
Stop it, Lieutenant.

11
00:15.840 --> 00:18.410
Leave it to the justice system.

12
00:18.610 --> 00:19.590
I promise you,

13
00:20.150 --> 00:21.680
the law will punish him

14
00:21.870 --> 00:23.810
no less than karmic law will.

15
00:28.550 --> 00:29.360
Faii!

16
00:29.360 --> 00:31.000
Faii...

17
00:31.190 --> 00:31.980
My beloved.

18
00:32.400 --> 00:33.490
Are you alright?

19
00:42.760 --> 00:44.040
Where did that come from?

20
00:46.650 --> 00:47.390
What happened?

21
00:48.470 --> 00:49.980
Where did the sound of the gun come from?

22
01:08.520 --> 01:09.770
Was it you, Zai?

23
01:12.650 --> 01:13.560
Indeed, Father.

24
01:14.840 --> 01:15.630
It was me.

25
01:30.210 --> 01:31.670
As you were performing the ritual,

26
01:32.960 --> 01:34.840
the crow would not cease to caw;

27
01:36.750 --> 01:38.160
thus, I took care of it.

28
01:38.430 --> 01:39.720
Did I ask you to?

29
01:41.200 --> 01:42.830
Do not shed blood within the sanctum.

30
01:44.120 --> 01:45.600
It is ill-fated!

31
01:49.040 --> 01:49.670
Father...

32
01:52.530 --> 01:53.830
But I meant well.

33
01:59.980 --> 02:01.010
Why, Father?

34
02:02.910 --> 02:04.330
No matter what I do,

35
02:05.520 --> 02:07.000
it can never seem to please you.

36
02:07.000 --> 02:09.000
Because all you have done is commit foolish deeds!

37
02:09.830 --> 02:12.400
Why not bestow your efforts upon learning useful arts

38
02:12.990 --> 02:14.830
instead of trying to please me?!

39
02:15.530 --> 02:16.240
Then...

40
02:25.110 --> 02:25.980
Dear Father,

41
02:28.170 --> 02:29.480
teach me your arts, please?

42
02:40.850 --> 02:41.720
See?

43
02:44.310 --> 02:45.550
You would not.

44
02:46.200 --> 02:47.980
When I sought to learn it myself,

45
02:48.550 --> 02:50.590
you condemned it as low arts.

46
02:50.590 --> 02:53.250
The damn arts you sought to learn were hexes!

47
02:53.550 --> 02:55.310
Those that corrode the lives of others!

48
02:55.670 --> 02:57.980
Do you still even entertain the thought of learning low arts?

49
02:58.850 --> 02:59.560
Huh?!

50
03:04.160 --> 03:05.200
Of course...

51
03:07.730 --> 03:08.880
this son of yours

52
03:09.190 --> 03:11.440
only revels in low arts.

53
03:13.980 --> 03:15.270
He is no golden child of yours,

54
03:18.110 --> 03:19.590
unlike Bulan.

55
03:20.520 --> 03:21.980
Just a word from her,

56
03:22.470 --> 03:24.710
and you are willing to bequeath her your arts, huh?!

57
03:24.710 --> 03:25.530
Zai, you...

58
03:26.710 --> 03:27.980
Darling, darling!

59
03:29.130 --> 03:29.850
- Father! - Bulan!

60
03:29.850 --> 03:30.870
Begone!!

61
03:31.440 --> 03:33.390
Away from my sanctum at once.

62
03:35.640 --> 03:38.610
Should you not even so much as consider changing your spots,

63
03:38.610 --> 03:40.770
do not show your face afore me!

64
03:43.030 --> 03:43.800
Go!

65
03:51.610 --> 03:52.280
Father...

66
03:54.110 --> 03:55.280
I used to wonder

67
03:56.950 --> 03:58.870
which soul

68
04:00.560 --> 04:01.750
was more ill-fated,

69
04:05.480 --> 04:06.710
this crow

70
04:08.590 --> 04:10.550
or myself.

71
04:11.230 --> 04:12.270
Father,

72
04:13.410 --> 04:14.570
Mother,

73
04:15.980 --> 04:17.210
and you wench, Bulan,

74
04:21.810 --> 04:23.980
do mark my words.

75
04:25.570 --> 04:27.710
I shall never tread upon this domain again

76
04:29.480 --> 04:31.670
until I have mastered all arts.

77
04:34.430 --> 04:36.440
Then, I shall return and take back what is mine.

78
05:40.770 --> 05:45.120
♫Along with ghostly spirits hounding relentlessly,♫

79
05:45.130 --> 05:49.730
♫May the maras be ravaged and perish completely♫

80
05:49.730 --> 05:54.160
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

81
05:54.160 --> 05:58.510
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

82
05:58.510 --> 06:02.840
♫Were any souls to brush against my karmic soulmate,♫

83
06:02.840 --> 06:07.550
♫They shall bury the thought of returning to their realm♫

84
06:07.550 --> 06:11.630
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

85
06:11.630 --> 06:15.980
♫At my feet, they shall surrender and kneel,♫

86
06:15.980 --> 06:21.760
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

87
06:44.410 --> 06:46.570
[Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

88
06:46.570 --> 06:48.280
If you agree to speak now,

89
06:48.510 --> 06:50.350
the court might reduce

90
06:50.650 --> 06:52.110
your life sentence by half.

91
06:55.410 --> 06:56.450
Answer!

92
06:57.240 --> 06:58.670
Who's backing you?

93
07:02.170 --> 07:03.610
Don't let me get physical with you.

94
07:09.000 --> 07:10.470
I know you have impenetrable skin,

95
07:13.690 --> 07:15.120
but at point-blank range,

96
07:15.450 --> 07:17.000
it's gonna bruise you more or less.

97
07:19.160 --> 07:19.980
Inspector...

98
07:25.550 --> 07:27.010
Get me a cig,

99
07:27.020 --> 07:28.250
and I'll tell ya.

100
07:28.250 --> 07:29.480
"Cig," my fucking ass.

101
07:29.980 --> 07:30.850
Inspector.

102
07:32.490 --> 07:33.290
Go on...

103
07:45.810 --> 07:46.710
Go on, Inspector.

104
07:47.270 --> 07:47.980
Lieutenant...

105
07:48.800 --> 07:50.560
Enough. Cut it. Cut it now.

106
07:53.570 --> 07:54.880
I know you hold grudges.

107
07:55.470 --> 07:56.810
You would, since they wrecked you.

108
07:56.810 --> 07:57.980
But this is not right!

109
07:58.750 --> 07:59.360
Cut it, Inspector.

110
07:59.360 --> 07:59.980
Put away your gun.

111
08:03.450 --> 08:04.400
Lieutenant, come here.

112
08:06.790 --> 08:07.830
What, Sarge?

113
08:07.830 --> 08:09.200
Thank you, man.

114
08:14.270 --> 08:15.210
Ugh, Sarge...

115
08:15.980 --> 08:16.990
What?!

116
08:19.810 --> 08:21.980
Don't you see that the guy wouldn't say a word?

117
08:22.670 --> 08:23.850
So which clue would we gather

118
08:23.850 --> 08:24.810
to eradicate

119
08:24.810 --> 08:26.230
their organization?

120
08:26.570 --> 08:27.520
Calm down, Lieutenant.

121
08:28.150 --> 08:29.240
If he's refusing to speak,

122
08:29.980 --> 08:31.730
let's just find someone who makes him speak.

123
08:35.750 --> 08:36.600
Who, Sarge?

124
08:38.200 --> 08:38.600
Ugh...

125
08:38.600 --> 08:39.800
Easy, Sarge!

126
08:40.320 --> 08:41.390
You're hurting me!

127
08:41.640 --> 08:42.880
I'm no criminal!

128
08:43.320 --> 08:44.610
Cooperate

129
08:44.910 --> 08:45.790
so we get this over with!

130
08:47.790 --> 08:49.430
I hope for my sake that we do.

131
08:50.840 --> 08:52.610
Whether this ends or not

132
08:52.610 --> 08:54.730
is up to what you can offer.

133
08:56.110 --> 08:56.510
Go.

134
08:56.510 --> 08:57.290
Go!

135
08:57.980 --> 08:58.830
Ow... Ouch.

136
09:13.320 --> 09:15.980
So you're the one who told the fucking cops, you fucker?!

137
09:15.980 --> 09:16.430
Sit down!

138
09:16.430 --> 09:17.250
Bastard!

139
09:17.250 --> 09:17.980
Sit down!

140
09:17.980 --> 09:18.880
Stop.

141
09:19.040 --> 09:21.730
Whenever I get out, you're gonna die at my fucking feet.

142
09:22.250 --> 09:23.570
Take off the handcuffs!

143
09:27.870 --> 09:28.730
Lieutenant,

144
09:30.520 --> 09:31.960
this has to end today.

145
09:32.840 --> 09:35.350
I don't want to be caught up in this ridiculous mess anymore.

146
09:38.230 --> 09:39.980
Can I speak with him alone?

147
10:00.730 --> 10:01.980
What the fuck are you doing?

148
10:06.350 --> 10:07.240
Hey, Sarge.

149
10:07.980 --> 10:09.170
Is it a good idea

150
10:09.170 --> 10:09.980
to leave those two alone?

151
10:10.670 --> 10:12.250
What if Krating kills Seua?

152
10:12.810 --> 10:13.750
It's gonna be fine.

153
10:13.750 --> 10:14.720
If Seua the Tiger dies,

154
10:14.720 --> 10:15.980
put some money on the shrimp,

155
10:15.980 --> 10:17.230
chicken, or calabash, playing Hoo Hey How.

156
10:17.640 --> 10:18.560
If that's not satisfying enough,

157
10:18.560 --> 10:19.650
add more up top.

158
10:20.490 --> 10:21.310
You're being random.

159
10:22.280 --> 10:23.040
I'll take my leave.

160
10:27.010 --> 10:27.980
What the fuck are you doing?

161
10:30.250 --> 10:31.490
Easy, man.

162
10:32.330 --> 10:34.290
We can talk this out.

163
10:36.350 --> 10:38.190
Any info or clues you know,

164
10:38.190 --> 10:39.470
just tell the cops.

165
10:40.270 --> 10:41.980
If you're sentenced to life in prison,

166
10:42.560 --> 10:44.170
what about the dream you told me

167
10:44.400 --> 10:46.990
about moving your family to Thailand?

168
10:47.470 --> 10:49.550
Don't you want your parents to have a comfortable life?

169
10:49.870 --> 10:51.490
You won't get to live up to that anymore.

170
10:53.170 --> 10:55.560
Don't stick your fucking nose in my family's business.

171
10:55.980 --> 10:56.960
Why?

172
10:57.590 --> 10:58.790
Is it the tiger tattoo?

173
10:59.310 --> 11:00.550
I also have that.

174
11:00.790 --> 11:01.800
You took me to get one,

175
11:02.640 --> 11:03.980
saying you'd get me into the ring.

176
11:07.870 --> 11:08.800
Right...

177
11:11.280 --> 11:13.110
Or was the master who gave the tattoo

178
11:14.370 --> 11:15.250
the ringleader?

179
11:15.250 --> 11:16.280
Seua, you fucker!

180
11:16.280 --> 11:17.640
Shut the fuck up, bastard!

181
11:18.770 --> 11:19.830
What the fuck are you saying?

182
11:20.560 --> 11:21.720
Let me tell you right now.

183
11:23.030 --> 11:25.030
Don't speak about that man at all costs, you hear me?

184
11:26.650 --> 11:27.980
Also, don't mention his name,

185
11:28.330 --> 11:29.980
or everyone here will fucking die, you fucker!

186
11:30.470 --> 11:31.200
Leave!

187
11:31.480 --> 11:32.630
You fucker!

188
11:34.150 --> 11:34.790
This prick.

189
11:35.510 --> 11:36.800
Remove these fucking handcuffs!

190
11:36.800 --> 11:37.570
Leave!

191
11:37.570 --> 11:38.770
I said leave, bastard!

192
11:38.770 --> 11:39.610
Whoa, what the heck?

193
11:39.610 --> 11:40.470
Damn it...

194
11:41.800 --> 11:43.010
Go away, you piece of shit!

195
11:43.150 --> 11:43.590
Hey...

196
11:43.590 --> 11:44.410
What's the matter?!

197
11:50.290 --> 11:51.550
Got nothing out of him, Lieutenant.

198
11:52.160 --> 11:53.650
He wouldn't tell me who was behind it.

199
11:54.250 --> 11:55.440
Is my job done here?

200
11:55.730 --> 11:56.890
Then, I'll head out.

201
11:57.240 --> 11:57.790
Hey...

202
11:59.680 --> 12:01.570
even though he didn't say anything,

203
12:02.230 --> 12:03.770
I know...

204
12:03.770 --> 12:04.570
that you know.

205
12:09.430 --> 12:11.550
You have the same yantra Krating has, don't you?

206
12:12.800 --> 12:14.360
That would mean...

207
12:14.490 --> 12:16.910
you got it from the same sanctum.

208
12:19.210 --> 12:20.550
And I heard it.

209
12:20.730 --> 12:22.520
I heard Krating say

210
12:22.750 --> 12:24.760
not to mention that name at all costs.

211
12:25.590 --> 12:26.680
As a matter of fact,

212
12:26.680 --> 12:30.210
the one behind this human trafficking syndicate

213
12:30.790 --> 12:32.890
is the master who gave you guys the yantra, right?

214
12:33.510 --> 12:34.400
Answer me!

215
12:37.650 --> 12:38.850
I really don't know.

216
12:43.390 --> 12:44.530
Say his name

217
12:46.910 --> 12:47.980
so we can get this over with.

218
12:48.510 --> 12:49.710
If I said it,

219
12:49.870 --> 12:51.750
could you even take responsibility for my life?

220
12:51.980 --> 12:53.720
If you don't say it,

221
12:53.720 --> 12:55.430
I'll fucking kill you right here.

222
12:55.980 --> 12:56.910
So are you gonna say it?

223
13:00.570 --> 13:01.360
Say it!

224
13:02.560 --> 13:03.320
Seua...

225
13:04.910 --> 13:05.980
I'm telling you to fucking speak.

226
13:07.980 --> 13:08.800
Well...

227
13:09.560 --> 13:11.980
the master who tattooed the tiger yantra on us...

228
13:13.720 --> 13:15.170
is a master in Myanmar.

229
13:15.170 --> 13:15.980
His name is...

230
13:19.650 --> 13:20.560
Zai...

231
13:26.000 --> 13:27.190
There, I said it.

232
13:28.760 --> 13:29.790
Can I head back now?

233
13:31.840 --> 13:32.770
Thank you

234
13:33.830 --> 13:35.280
for your cooperation.

235
13:35.280 --> 13:37.790
I'll investigate further into the information you gave.

236
13:39.000 --> 13:39.640
Right,

237
13:40.920 --> 13:42.240
keep your word, Lieutenant.

238
13:42.920 --> 13:44.310
I hope we never meet again.

239
13:54.480 --> 13:55.280
Whoa?

240
13:55.670 --> 13:56.370
Seua...

241
13:57.610 --> 13:58.390
Seua.

242
13:59.480 --> 14:00.360
Seua!

243
14:00.550 --> 14:01.200
Seua?

244
14:01.200 --> 14:01.840
Seua!

245
14:02.680 --> 14:03.560
Seua!

246
14:05.980 --> 14:06.610
Whoa?

247
14:06.610 --> 14:07.440
Fuck...

248
14:07.770 --> 14:08.560
Shit...

249
14:14.090 --> 14:14.810
Lieutenant...

250
14:23.010 --> 14:23.980
Shit...

251
14:24.790 --> 14:25.730
Fuck...

252
14:31.980 --> 14:32.990
What the fuck is this?

253
14:43.390 --> 14:43.790
Whoa...

254
14:43.790 --> 14:44.710
Inspector.

255
14:44.710 --> 14:45.750
Something's wrong with him.

256
14:47.390 --> 14:48.370
Shit...

257
14:59.430 --> 15:00.530
From the look of it,

258
15:01.170 --> 15:02.160
this is the Death Inflicted yantra.

259
15:03.160 --> 15:04.240
Someone's cast a spell on them.

260
15:05.290 --> 15:07.010
If the name is spoken aloud, they're dead.

261
15:44.490 --> 15:46.490
It has indeed been a while, my dear little sister.

262
15:51.980 --> 15:53.290
Is it time?

263
15:53.570 --> 15:55.050
Is it why you swallowed your pride

264
15:55.050 --> 15:56.800
and came crawling back here at this domain?

265
15:58.230 --> 15:59.160
In fact...

266
16:02.310 --> 16:04.350
I should like to tarry a bit longer,

267
16:06.840 --> 16:07.650
but because of you...

268
16:11.480 --> 16:12.600
and your meddlesome self!

269
16:14.520 --> 16:16.290
Those glyphs on the bullets,

270
16:17.360 --> 16:19.410
I know full well they are in your handwriting.

271
16:21.810 --> 16:23.590
And whose peace in hell have I disturbed?

272
16:25.530 --> 16:27.270
It seems you cannot leave it well enough alone,

273
16:28.170 --> 16:29.980
aiding those people

274
16:30.110 --> 16:31.410
in capturing my disciples.

275
16:33.450 --> 16:34.290
Bulan...

276
16:35.840 --> 16:37.960
Should you wish to pit your arts against mine,

277
16:38.770 --> 16:39.730
today

278
16:40.640 --> 16:42.520
I shall show you.

279
16:43.440 --> 16:46.710
My sacred arts are to be worshipped,

280
16:47.390 --> 16:49.470
not to be honed and maneuvered

281
16:49.470 --> 16:51.980
like your despicable low arts.

282
16:52.250 --> 16:53.720
Do not even so much as think of walking abreast!

283
16:57.810 --> 16:59.290
Sharp-tongued at that...

284
17:00.250 --> 17:01.640
Bulan, my dear sister,

285
17:02.910 --> 17:03.790
today...

286
17:04.530 --> 17:05.720
I shall kill you,

287
17:06.480 --> 17:09.010
revive you as a raised ghost,

288
17:09.170 --> 17:11.030
and turn you into my servant.

289
17:43.800 --> 17:44.890
So that...

290
17:45.770 --> 17:47.090
was your sacred art?

291
17:47.090 --> 17:49.030
The profane arts you cling to

292
17:49.710 --> 17:51.480
shall one day become a sword

293
17:51.480 --> 17:52.890
that beheads you.

294
17:54.720 --> 17:55.550
Zai...

295
17:55.550 --> 17:57.720
Out of consideration for Venerable Mother's nunhood,

296
17:58.690 --> 18:00.720
I shall warn you one last time.

297
18:01.430 --> 18:02.530
Cease this

298
18:03.280 --> 18:04.880
before it becomes unsalvageable.

299
18:19.350 --> 18:20.610
Tormenting, huh?

300
18:23.560 --> 18:24.970
Keep your mouth shut.

301
18:26.240 --> 18:27.980
Bridle me not.

302
18:31.370 --> 18:33.280
Did Father not utter that

303
18:35.270 --> 18:37.000
once your path crossed with that of your karmic soulmate,

304
18:38.130 --> 18:40.270
your sacred arts shall be strengthened?

305
18:46.210 --> 18:47.240
But how come...

306
18:47.980 --> 18:51.980
you are defeated by the arts you condemned as low?

307
18:56.370 --> 18:57.770
Let go of Master Bulan.

308
19:06.520 --> 19:08.440
I am disciplining my younger sister.

309
19:08.960 --> 19:09.980
Do not fucking meddle!

310
19:15.480 --> 19:17.370
It is between family.

311
19:19.320 --> 19:20.880
Thus, it is no skin off a police officer's back.

312
19:25.360 --> 19:26.440
Oh, it is.

313
19:27.110 --> 19:30.370
Because Master Bulan is my family.

314
19:30.720 --> 19:32.490
If you don't want a consecrated bullet

315
19:32.490 --> 19:34.610
right in your fucking head, let her go!

316
19:34.760 --> 19:35.980
What are you doing...

317
19:36.120 --> 19:37.600
What on earth are you doing?!

318
19:39.980 --> 19:40.800
Very well...

319
19:41.980 --> 19:43.160
Then,

320
19:43.980 --> 19:45.170
let us see

321
19:45.980 --> 19:47.410
whether blood

322
19:48.610 --> 19:50.600
is thicker than water.

323
19:51.680 --> 19:52.520
Come here.

324
20:00.710 --> 20:01.670
Om...

325
20:12.510 --> 20:13.670
Peem...

326
20:25.980 --> 20:28.280
I'm already dead and a ghost because of you,

327
20:28.770 --> 20:31.980
and you're still shooting me dead again with a consecrated bullet?

328
20:42.240 --> 20:45.510
My little sister would never, ever say something like that.

329
21:02.710 --> 21:05.030
Have you no consecrated bullets left?

330
21:11.290 --> 21:12.770
Please don't kill each other...

331
21:47.240 --> 21:49.250
Treasure your hearts well,

332
21:51.590 --> 21:52.810
for when the time comes,

333
21:54.570 --> 21:56.990
I shall reap them from both your chests.

334
22:43.710 --> 22:46.290
The term "karmic soulmate,"

335
22:47.590 --> 22:48.760
what does it mean?

336
22:49.360 --> 22:50.610
Your existence

337
22:50.990 --> 22:54.990
makes Master a woman of boundless might and virtue.

338
22:55.590 --> 22:57.980
But on the other hand,

339
22:59.130 --> 23:01.190
Master's weakness...

340
23:01.630 --> 23:03.370
has started to take shape.

341
23:14.590 --> 23:15.450
My beloved...

342
23:15.810 --> 23:16.520
My beloved.

343
23:17.320 --> 23:18.350
Don't get up just yet.

344
23:19.650 --> 23:20.630
Get some rest.

345
23:22.240 --> 23:23.170
Take it easy.

346
23:39.160 --> 23:40.990
How did you come to my rescue, my dearest?

347
23:44.760 --> 23:46.680
Thong came to get me to help you.

348
23:48.430 --> 23:49.270
My beloved...

349
23:52.510 --> 23:53.980
I'm sorry

350
23:55.980 --> 23:57.760
that I took too long to help you.

351
24:00.810 --> 24:03.190
That's why you're hurt like this.

352
24:09.270 --> 24:10.400
It matters not.

353
24:11.350 --> 24:12.990
Your beloved is now safe and sound.

354
24:14.210 --> 24:15.770
Do not blame yourself, my dearest.

355
24:21.790 --> 24:22.590
So...

356
24:23.310 --> 24:25.360
who was the guy that hurt you?

357
24:27.390 --> 24:28.530
Can you tell me?

358
24:38.690 --> 24:40.200
My elder brother,

359
24:41.290 --> 24:42.280
Zai.

360
24:49.590 --> 24:51.550
Know you of my elder brother?

361
24:56.190 --> 24:58.530
Well, if he's the same guy I know,

362
24:59.760 --> 25:02.590
then he's behind the whole thing with Krating.

363
25:06.590 --> 25:07.470
My beloved...

364
25:11.790 --> 25:14.310
would you tell me

365
25:15.170 --> 25:17.550
the story about your older brother?

366
25:20.970 --> 25:23.010
If it is of use to you,

367
25:24.770 --> 25:26.440
I shall, my beloved.

368
25:29.810 --> 25:32.670
My elder brother and I entered the world seven years apart;

369
25:34.130 --> 25:35.670
thus, we were never very close.

370
25:37.030 --> 25:38.670
My elder brother

371
25:39.770 --> 25:41.980
yearned to learn the sacred arts from Father

372
25:42.870 --> 25:44.840
and to inherit the family's legacy.

373
25:49.830 --> 25:51.040
Father did not choose him.

374
25:53.470 --> 25:54.670
But he chose you.

375
25:57.980 --> 26:00.870
No parents wish to see their children quarrel.

376
26:02.490 --> 26:04.830
It was the sacred masters' decision.

377
26:07.670 --> 26:09.720
With different passions,

378
26:10.530 --> 26:11.980
my brother and I...

379
26:12.810 --> 26:14.550
walked different paths.

380
26:32.790 --> 26:33.610
Mother...

381
26:33.610 --> 26:34.320
what is happening?

382
26:34.560 --> 26:35.400
- Mother... - Whoa...

383
26:40.490 --> 26:41.690
Mother... Mother!

384
26:42.560 --> 26:43.350
Mother...

385
26:43.350 --> 26:44.390
Mother, what is going on?

386
26:45.280 --> 26:45.870
Father!

387
26:45.870 --> 26:46.810
Help Mother, please!

388
26:48.590 --> 26:49.490
- Mother... Mother! - Chan.

389
26:49.490 --> 26:50.290
Chan!

390
27:02.190 --> 27:03.980
What is the family's tiger?

391
27:06.870 --> 27:09.980
It was our ancestor who practiced magic to such an extent

392
27:10.570 --> 27:13.250
that it eventually rebounded upon them.

393
27:14.680 --> 27:16.320
Their body

394
27:16.770 --> 27:18.840
gradually turned into that of a Saming.

395
27:24.270 --> 27:25.980
Weretiger...

396
27:28.950 --> 27:31.980
The glyphs that were worked onto Krating's body

397
27:33.150 --> 27:35.800
are my elder brother's.

398
27:37.980 --> 27:39.600
My elder brother

399
27:39.980 --> 27:42.430
yearned to claim the family's tiger.

400
27:43.480 --> 27:44.880
Legend has it that

401
27:45.650 --> 27:47.980
whoever possesses the family's tiger

402
27:48.890 --> 27:51.750
shall become the mightiest sorcerer of all.

403
27:53.980 --> 27:54.990
So...

404
27:56.850 --> 27:59.240
this family's tiger...

405
27:59.670 --> 28:00.800
where is it now?

406
28:10.110 --> 28:11.980
It is no one's responsibility but mine.

407
28:31.770 --> 28:33.640
It must have been so painful,

408
28:34.430 --> 28:37.200
having carried so much on your shoulders.

409
28:41.980 --> 28:43.600
Don't worry, though.

410
28:45.290 --> 28:47.210
From now on,

411
28:49.850 --> 28:51.840
this dearest of yours will help ease your burden.

412
28:54.590 --> 28:56.590
I'll hold your hand

413
28:56.850 --> 28:57.710
and...

414
28:57.850 --> 28:59.980
stay by your side like this, always.

415
29:39.750 --> 29:41.000
My dearest, follow me.

416
29:50.120 --> 29:51.010
Mother...

417
29:55.850 --> 29:56.840
Hello.

418
30:03.320 --> 30:05.690
You are shielded by the charm of metta,

419
30:06.110 --> 30:07.400
which is hard to come by.

420
30:08.750 --> 30:10.830
It is indeed what your father proclaimed.

421
30:13.980 --> 30:16.430
He said that my beautiful daughter Bulan

422
30:16.430 --> 30:17.550
shall meet a lover

423
30:18.750 --> 30:20.160
whose appearance

424
30:20.320 --> 30:21.980
is in this very manner,

425
30:22.880 --> 30:24.250
and that if I do not believe it,

426
30:25.520 --> 30:27.440
I shall linger to see with my own eyes,

427
30:27.720 --> 30:29.490
so I would know he spoke no lies.

428
30:30.490 --> 30:31.670
This day,

429
30:31.980 --> 30:34.290
I have finally witnessed the truth in his words.

430
30:39.690 --> 30:41.980
I suppose you did not merely bring her here to introduce her to me.

431
30:42.670 --> 30:44.480
What is the reason

432
30:44.920 --> 30:45.980
you two paid me a visit?

433
30:48.990 --> 30:50.990
Treasure your hearts well,

434
30:51.320 --> 30:52.640
for when the time comes,

435
30:53.320 --> 30:55.730
I shall reap them from both your chests.

436
31:01.330 --> 31:02.990
He came for me at home,

437
31:03.800 --> 31:05.730
proclaiming that he would maim my heart.

438
31:08.630 --> 31:11.000
He wounded you once afore.

439
31:11.680 --> 31:13.760
I fear he would do it to you again.

440
31:19.750 --> 31:21.210
Worry not about me.

441
31:21.980 --> 31:24.450
I dwell under the protection of the Triple Gem of Buddhism.

442
31:25.870 --> 31:27.280
No profane arts

443
31:27.400 --> 31:28.880
could harm me.

444
31:35.530 --> 31:37.160
My beautiful daughter,

445
31:38.130 --> 31:39.430
are you angry at me

446
31:40.190 --> 31:41.830
for not raising him well,

447
31:42.810 --> 31:44.440
for not instilling in him

448
31:44.670 --> 31:46.990
the difference between good and bad?

449
31:48.160 --> 31:50.350
Thus, he chose the wrong path to walk upon.

450
31:52.490 --> 31:53.240
Mother,

451
31:53.730 --> 31:55.310
blame yourself not.

452
31:55.730 --> 31:57.030
This matter is subjective,

453
31:57.520 --> 31:59.210
hinging on nature.

454
31:59.560 --> 32:01.000
I too was raised by you,

455
32:01.870 --> 32:05.530
yet I do not mistake a chakram for a lotus.

456
32:08.690 --> 32:10.810
I shall leave her in your care.

457
32:11.690 --> 32:13.250
In time to come,

458
32:13.980 --> 32:15.710
even though there lie obstacles,

459
32:17.330 --> 32:19.980
pray you, do not let go of each other's hands.

460
32:21.800 --> 32:22.520
Of course.

461
32:23.560 --> 32:25.770
No matter what happens in the future,

462
32:26.170 --> 32:27.840
I promise that...

463
32:28.810 --> 32:30.680
I will hold on to Master Bulan's hands

464
32:33.450 --> 32:34.650
without letting go.

465
32:40.830 --> 32:42.480
What say you, dear Bulan?

466
32:48.680 --> 32:51.030
The days are yet to come.

467
32:52.120 --> 32:54.400
I do not wish to break my word,

468
32:55.440 --> 32:57.190
for I know not

469
32:57.840 --> 33:00.240
if the days to come shall prove to be as I fathom.

470
33:02.190 --> 33:03.980
Spirits and earthly bodies

471
33:04.750 --> 33:06.440
are bound to part when the time comes.

472
33:08.710 --> 33:10.170
You know well

473
33:10.910 --> 33:12.590
that when the time comes to forsake,

474
33:13.450 --> 33:14.790
you ought to do so.

475
33:16.920 --> 33:18.760
I do not wish to answer questions

476
33:18.760 --> 33:20.320
regarding matters that are yet to come.

477
33:23.110 --> 33:24.310
Know you...

478
33:25.320 --> 33:26.800
how deeply I love her?

479
33:28.250 --> 33:29.980
Should I lose her,

480
33:31.980 --> 33:33.550
I do not suppose I could live.

481
34:00.710 --> 34:02.360
It's okay

482
34:03.010 --> 34:05.360
if you don't want to be hand in hand with me

483
34:05.650 --> 34:06.810
when that day comes.

484
34:09.010 --> 34:10.630
But I want you to know that...

485
34:11.590 --> 34:13.980
I will always be by your side like this

486
34:14.780 --> 34:17.430
no matter what comes our way,

487
34:17.460 --> 34:17.990
or...

488
34:18.490 --> 34:21.290
no matter how much things change.

489
34:23.280 --> 34:24.440
I'm confident that

490
34:27.110 --> 34:28.370
I will...

491
34:28.370 --> 34:30.920
hold your hand like this forever, as your dearest.

492
34:41.980 --> 34:44.320
[Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

493
34:44.320 --> 34:45.760
Last week,

494
34:45.760 --> 34:47.050
the police

495
34:47.050 --> 34:49.080
arrested Krating,

496
34:49.080 --> 34:51.470
along with all the accomplices in the human-trafficking syndicate,

497
34:51.470 --> 34:53.030
bringing the total to 13 individuals.

498
34:53.400 --> 34:55.090
This operation

499
34:55.090 --> 34:57.530
is a joint effort by Mae Sot Police Station,

500
34:57.530 --> 34:58.750
Phop Phra Police Station,

501
34:58.750 --> 34:59.980
and other relevant authorities.

502
34:59.980 --> 35:00.710
Sir,

503
35:00.710 --> 35:03.400
there's been a rumor circulating about how the suspect in custody

504
35:03.400 --> 35:04.920
mysteriously passed away at the police station.

505
35:04.920 --> 35:05.720
Is it true?

506
35:06.400 --> 35:07.360
What do you say, sir?

507
35:07.980 --> 35:08.760
Yes.

508
35:09.400 --> 35:11.980
All the suspects in this case have passed away.

509
35:11.980 --> 35:13.410
What are their causes of death?

510
35:13.410 --> 35:15.510
Is this a murder to cover up the truth?

511
35:15.510 --> 35:17.000
- Is there anyone behind it? - Is it true that someone's behind this?

512
35:17.010 --> 35:17.980
Please answer the questions.

513
35:17.980 --> 35:19.480
Please answer the questions.

514
35:19.480 --> 35:20.630
Right now,

515
35:20.630 --> 35:23.090
the police are gathering evidence,

516
35:23.090 --> 35:23.980
and everything in the case file

517
35:23.980 --> 35:26.160
cannot be disclosed to the public yet.

518
35:26.330 --> 35:26.960
But, sir,

519
35:26.960 --> 35:27.980
the people want answers.

520
35:27.980 --> 35:28.950
Please answer some of them.

521
35:28.950 --> 35:30.450
Could you provide more clarification?

522
35:32.690 --> 35:33.830
Right now,

523
35:33.830 --> 35:35.290
please allow some time for the police

524
35:35.290 --> 35:36.570
to work on the case.

525
35:39.980 --> 35:42.490
You said the person behind all this

526
35:42.650 --> 35:44.240
is a master sorcerer.

527
35:44.630 --> 35:46.670
How are we gonna proceed now?

528
35:51.980 --> 35:54.390
[Mom]

529
36:04.280 --> 36:05.330
Hello.

530
36:06.990 --> 36:08.240
Of course, absolutely.

531
36:09.550 --> 36:10.450
Right away.

532
36:11.630 --> 36:12.450
Lieutenant Peem,

533
36:14.640 --> 36:15.450
this is for you.

534
36:33.710 --> 36:34.840
Hello.

535
36:35.490 --> 36:36.240
Peem,

536
36:36.720 --> 36:38.730
how dare you lie to me?

537
36:40.010 --> 36:41.160
Mom...

538
36:41.550 --> 36:44.390
Why did you call the superintendent's number?

539
36:44.720 --> 36:46.270
Don't change the subject on me, Peem.

540
36:46.570 --> 36:47.980
Come home at once.

541
36:48.170 --> 36:50.210
Don't force me to come for you myself,

542
36:50.410 --> 36:52.240
or someone will be in trouble.

543
37:01.980 --> 37:03.290
Okay, Mom.

544
37:04.570 --> 37:06.290
I'll be right there.

545
38:05.680 --> 38:07.510
So...

546
38:09.870 --> 38:11.610
Breathe your words.

547
38:11.610 --> 38:13.370
Do not hem and haw.

548
38:13.760 --> 38:15.120
I shall not chide you.

549
38:17.010 --> 38:18.130
Jeez...

550
38:18.320 --> 38:18.910
Hey...

551
38:19.080 --> 38:20.680
speaking in that stern voice,

552
38:21.120 --> 38:23.050
and you're still not chiding me?

553
38:24.440 --> 38:25.480
Should you not say a word,

554
38:25.840 --> 38:27.250
I shall seek my bed.

555
38:27.830 --> 38:28.550
Huh...

556
38:28.550 --> 38:29.650
You're getting sulky like a child.

557
38:29.980 --> 38:31.270
Fine,

558
38:31.490 --> 38:32.430
I'll tell you now.

559
38:33.730 --> 38:35.980
So...

560
38:36.990 --> 38:37.490
Uh.

561
38:37.850 --> 38:38.890
- Ow... - You are dragging on.

562
38:41.670 --> 38:42.710
So...

563
38:43.410 --> 38:45.010
Earlier...

564
38:45.690 --> 38:48.400
you introduced me to...

565
38:48.870 --> 38:49.980
Vulnerable Mother,

566
38:50.330 --> 38:51.810
a nun who is...

567
38:52.710 --> 38:54.270
your mother, right, my beloved?

568
38:55.980 --> 38:56.650
Mm.

569
38:56.920 --> 38:57.980
And?

570
38:59.640 --> 39:00.980
And...

571
39:02.680 --> 39:04.990
I just feel like...

572
39:05.760 --> 39:07.980
I want to introduce you...

573
39:08.370 --> 39:10.630
to my own family.

574
39:12.870 --> 39:14.320
You are bidding me

575
39:15.280 --> 39:17.590
to travel to your home in Bangkok,

576
39:17.590 --> 39:18.450
are you not?

577
39:22.800 --> 39:23.570
Mm.

578
39:27.980 --> 39:29.330
Do you want to?

579
39:34.290 --> 39:36.800
You need to speak of what is clouding your mind,

580
39:36.800 --> 39:37.980
and I shall answer.

581
39:46.430 --> 39:47.560
So...

582
39:49.750 --> 39:50.600
I...

583
39:51.130 --> 39:53.290
haven't told my mother from the start

584
39:53.290 --> 39:55.980
that the reason I transferred here...

585
39:56.250 --> 39:57.800
was to investigate...

586
39:58.210 --> 39:59.770
Krating's clues

587
40:00.330 --> 40:01.210
and...

588
40:03.850 --> 40:05.800
to win you over

589
40:06.520 --> 40:09.520
after you refused to make consecrated bullets for me in the beginning.

590
40:12.230 --> 40:14.240
You are saying

591
40:14.510 --> 40:16.160
that I too am at fault;

592
40:16.490 --> 40:18.710
thus, you wish me to shoulder the weight of karma with you,

593
40:18.910 --> 40:19.690
are you not?

594
40:20.650 --> 40:21.650
That's not what I'm saying.

595
40:22.330 --> 40:23.770
What you just said...

596
40:23.770 --> 40:25.010
I never said

597
40:25.010 --> 40:27.000
it was your fault.

598
40:27.530 --> 40:29.510
It's actually my fault.

599
40:29.510 --> 40:31.240
You can punish me however you want.

600
40:31.240 --> 40:32.450
I'll take it all.

601
40:33.410 --> 40:33.980
Here.

602
40:33.980 --> 40:34.890
My beloved...hit me...

603
40:34.890 --> 40:35.370
Ow.

604
40:35.980 --> 40:36.470
Ow...

605
40:36.470 --> 40:36.990
Ouch!

606
40:37.760 --> 40:38.830
Hit me again.

607
40:39.030 --> 40:39.980
Mm...

608
40:41.250 --> 40:42.410
Why did you stop?

609
41:01.080 --> 41:02.950
I shall travel to Bangkok with you.

610
41:04.970 --> 41:05.770
Really?

611
41:07.730 --> 41:08.990
You mean it?

612
41:13.430 --> 41:14.800
I never weave a lie.

613
41:23.320 --> 41:24.600
Thank you, my beloved.

614
41:26.360 --> 41:27.010
My beloved,

615
41:27.560 --> 41:28.960
you know...

616
41:29.790 --> 41:31.600
my mother

617
41:31.980 --> 41:33.980
is very kind,

618
41:34.430 --> 41:36.360
and I do believe

619
41:36.360 --> 41:37.520
that when...

620
41:37.800 --> 41:40.280
she meets you,

621
41:41.010 --> 41:42.570
she's gonna like you

622
41:42.890 --> 41:43.980
as much...

623
41:45.240 --> 41:47.190
as I do.

624
41:49.980 --> 41:51.510
I too wish so.

625
42:11.370 --> 42:14.710
[Bangkok]

626
42:33.410 --> 42:34.670
Hello, Miss Peem.

627
42:35.190 --> 42:36.570
- Hello, Uncle. - Hello.

628
42:36.910 --> 42:37.980
How have you been?

629
42:38.370 --> 42:39.440
I've been fine.

630
42:44.730 --> 42:45.650
Uncle,

631
42:46.200 --> 42:46.930
this...

632
42:47.390 --> 42:47.980
is Bulan,

633
42:48.390 --> 42:49.450
my girlfriend.

634
42:51.040 --> 42:51.630
Huh?

635
42:52.530 --> 42:53.200
Girlfriend?

636
42:54.360 --> 42:56.150
You have a girlfriend, Miss Peem?

637
42:57.400 --> 42:58.530
What is it, Sorn?

638
42:59.160 --> 43:00.610
Who is whose girlfriend?

639
43:01.230 --> 43:01.980
Auntie Thip...

640
43:07.840 --> 43:08.490
There...

641
43:08.680 --> 43:09.720
So, where...

642
43:09.980 --> 43:11.160
is this girlfriend of yours, Miss Peem?

643
43:11.320 --> 43:13.350
Let me take a look at her face.

644
43:14.550 --> 43:15.850
Healthy skin,

645
43:15.850 --> 43:17.400
a beautiful face,

646
43:17.980 --> 43:18.600
and a nice chest...

647
43:18.600 --> 43:19.870
waist, and hips...

648
43:21.980 --> 43:23.830
You made a good choice for yourself, Miss Peem.

649
43:26.470 --> 43:27.980
Let's go inside.

650
43:28.630 --> 43:30.720
Your mother is waiting.

651
43:30.720 --> 43:31.510
Sure thing.

652
43:31.510 --> 43:32.640
Please take care of it, Uncle Sorn.

653
43:32.640 --> 43:33.530
Of course, Miss Peem.

654
43:33.530 --> 43:34.360
Please.

655
44:16.810 --> 44:17.960
Miss Peem,

656
44:18.710 --> 44:19.980
lately, Mrs. Ratchapee

657
44:20.330 --> 44:21.980
has been acting strange.

658
44:22.640 --> 44:23.650
It is as though...

659
44:23.980 --> 44:25.120
she's sick.

660
44:31.160 --> 44:31.980
My beloved.

661
44:46.760 --> 44:47.980
Peem.

662
44:51.230 --> 44:52.440
You're home, my dear?

663
44:55.870 --> 44:56.870
Yes, Mom.

664
44:56.990 --> 44:57.980
I'm home.

665
45:37.050 --> 45:38.480
Aren't you a guest?

666
45:38.890 --> 45:41.010
You have no right to roam about

667
45:41.210 --> 45:43.630
without the homeowner's permission.

668
45:50.470 --> 45:52.570
Get out of my daughter's life.

669
45:52.570 --> 45:53.980
That way, I can be sure

670
45:54.250 --> 45:57.430
you won't cast any foul magic on my daughter.

671
45:57.650 --> 46:00.430
That we have met means destiny has led us to cross paths.

672
46:00.800 --> 46:03.520
But if this is as far as our past merit takes us,

673
46:03.520 --> 46:05.010
then so be it.

674
